<<cam_line "This line is deliberately longer than the bubble, so the prose has to scroll inside it while the paper stays exactly where it is. Watch the card's edge: it should not move at all. The text should stop at the black outline rather than paint over it, and the paper's translucency and shadow should not fade a single letter. The same card should hold still while the words travel. A link lives in this line too, [[Layouts->Layouts]], and once the line has landed it should still be a link you can click. The reveal grew the text nodes in place instead of replacing the markup.">>
<<player_line "The long line has landed. [[Layouts->Layouts]]">>

